    Organization logo > mint
domain Pacing, PACE
subsystem Active Phase, APHASE 50-99
class Active Pace Period, APP
attributes
    PTP : PTP ID {I, R53}
    Active program : Program Name {R53}
    Current duration : Duration
    Next duration : Duration
--
class Active Phase
attributes
    Active program : Program Name {I, R52}
    Initiating event : Event Code {I, R52}
--
class Active Program
attributes
    Name : Program Name {I, R50}
    Organ : Organ Name {I2, R50}
--
class Cued Program
attributes
    Next program : Program Name {I, R51}
    Active program : Program Name {I2, R51}
--
class Event <import:Pace Program>
attributes
    Code : Event Code {I}
--
class Organ <import:Pace Program>
attributes
    Name : Organ Name {I}
--
class Open Window
attributes
    Task window : Ordinal {I, R54}
    Timeline : Window ID {I2, R54}
    Program : Program Name {I2, R54}
    Region : Region Name {I2, R54}
    Event : Event Code {I2, R54}
--
class Pace Program <import:Pace Program>
attributes
    Name : Program Name {I}
--
class Pace Timeout Period <import:Pace Program>
attributes
    ID : PTP ID {I}
    Program : Program Name {I}
--
class Task Timeline <import:Pace Program>
attributes
    ID : Timeline ID {I}
    Program : Program Name {I}
    Region : Region Name {I}
    Event : Event Code {I}
--
class Task Window <import:Pace Program>
attributes
    Sequence : Ordinal {I}
    Timeline : Timeline ID {I}
    Program : Program Name {I}
    Region : Region Name {I}
    Event : Event Code {I}
--
relationships
    R50
    is pacing, 1c Organ
    is being paced by, 1c Pace Program
    1 Active Program
    Active Program.Organ -> Organ.Name
    Active Program.Name -> Pace Program.Name
--
    R51
    is taking control from, 1 Active Program
    is handing off control to, 1c Cued Program
    1 Cued Program
    Cued Program.Active program -> Active Program.Name
    Cued Program.Next program -> Pace Program.Name
--
    R52
    has most recently experienced, 1c Event
    is the most recent activity in, 1c Active Program
    1 Active Phase
    Active Phase.Initiating event -> Event.Code
    Active Phase.Program -> Active Program.Name
--
    R53
    activates, Mc Pace Timeout Period
    is activated by, 1c Active Program
    1 Active Pace Period
    Active Pace Period.Program -> Active Program.Name
    Active Pace Period.(PTP ID, Program) -> Pace Timeout Period.(ID, Program)
--
    R54
    opens, 1c Task Window
    is opened by, 1c Task Timeline
    1 Open Window
    Open Window.Task window -> Task Window.ID
    Open Window.(Timeline, Program, Region, Event) -> Task Timeline.(ID, Program, Region, Event)
--